{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/2thess",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/2thess.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.1",
      "source_sha256": "8dc206bfdc3ed988",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., how long it will be until the coming of the Antichrist."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.3",
      "source_sha256": "768f8584d39df1df",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., a man to carry [it] with him [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.4",
      "source_sha256": "fc75d810d0d76078",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He does not use the title of apostleship here, because those to whom it was written are perfect."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.5",
      "source_sha256": "55e07048cb793313",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., let each of you love the other, one another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.6",
      "source_sha256": "2e52d550cba2cc03",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., your perfection in faith and charity and patience."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.7",
      "source_sha256": "faccc8e33cb93d75",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., your resistance in the tribulations is strong."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.8",
      "source_sha256": "36279415e3c235dd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your enduring of tribulations is how you will obtain rewards. The sinful deeds of your neighbours are how they will have punishment. This, then, is the twofold thing that will happen on the day of judgement: reward for the just, punishment for sinners. So by enduring the persecution you are an example of this."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.9",
      "source_sha256": "96af7a35b818a5c6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., do not regret suffering it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.10",
      "source_sha256": "e9953967b8dc0dfc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it is certain, it is true."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.11",
      "source_sha256": "e609f9e4be787f29",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., his righteousness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.12",
      "source_sha256": "5c68a3d1f5cc2131",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., eternal life, as it will be given to us apostles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.13",
      "source_sha256": "06cd3429a67e0182",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it will not be like the first coming."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.14",
      "source_sha256": "9544ddda13ee692c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., he will destroy them all, not just one of the two groups: those who have not heard, and those who transgress."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.15",
      "source_sha256": "63c69796c7d3b311",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., they will endure."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.16",
      "source_sha256": "1945d7d5afcce913",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., without their suffering ever coming to an end, but destruction."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.17",
      "source_sha256": "c1e4014d50c897cc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., their destruction is from the face of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.18",
      "source_sha256": "c00e48427c72f7ec",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "by giving them rewards."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.19",
      "source_sha256": "5f61b1daaf6e90ac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., when he inflicts vengeance on sinners and gives rewards to the just."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.20",
      "source_sha256": "e2c29d4fb6a841db",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., you have believed the testimony we gave you about the day of judgement; or: the testimony has been entrusted to us, to give it about you on the day of judgement."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.21",
      "source_sha256": "038c61aee49a47a7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., we pray that the testimony we give about you may be good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.22",
      "source_sha256": "845ed02ebc727adc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., that you may do his will; or: that your will may be good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.23",
      "source_sha256": "70b8df0b80d783ac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., that you may have the work of faith in the strength of faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.24",
      "source_sha256": "72124d97a1687fd6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it is necessary if you are to go to meet Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.25",
      "source_sha256": "167e0225ae225b3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., since it remains for all to go to meet Christ, who will judge us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.26",
      "source_sha256": "02883c0349055ba0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is not that he would think a slow disturbance good, but that there should be none at all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.25d.27",
      "source_sha256": "919bd6d16879e626",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. by the wind of false doctrine, so that you may abandon the gospel teaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.1",
      "source_sha256": "57a3237decbbb88c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. even if they say that the Day of Judgement is coming"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.2",
      "source_sha256": "391db9fe88ceb715",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this is what is dearest to me, though you hear [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.3",
      "source_sha256": "c424d6895d693364",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. by anything that he has said"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.4",
      "source_sha256": "14c536fdccd2fa8f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. of complete sinfulness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.5",
      "source_sha256": "d8057b1e6647cce8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to Christ and his members, until the ruin of the Roman kingdom comes, i.e. the overthrow of the kingdom from the Romans; or the falling away of the faithful into unbelief; or until he comes whose name is 'discessio', i.e. the devil, for his name is 'discessio' (departure) and 'refuga' (deserter)"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.6",
      "source_sha256": "189f21e812446a72",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he will say that he possesses every power that properly belongs to God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.7",
      "source_sha256": "b8ff8ef646d797e4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as if he were God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.8",
      "source_sha256": "d331282ab3739ef3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will sit in the temple as Christ sat; or a rebuilding of the temple will be carried out by him, and he will preach the precepts of the law of the Old Testament, and the Jews will accept him as their abbot [?], and he will destroy the law of the New Testament"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.9",
      "source_sha256": "6d5a9b6acc920ac6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. is it something that you do not remember?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.10",
      "source_sha256": "1aa64376ce8fdcea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the destruction of the Roman kingdom before him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.11",
      "source_sha256": "39cc6a5f09091093",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you know what holds back his revelation, i.e. until the time comes that was foretold for him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.12",
      "source_sha256": "a065ae8f82477df9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. though it is not seen, it is not that his work has not come, for what he will do after his coming, his people are doing and his members are doing; this is what is hidden here [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.13",
      "source_sha256": "d12d8f9a7b561454",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as long as it holds, i.e. the kingdom"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.14",
      "source_sha256": "507177396b1f6e46",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for a while [?], so that it may not be for long"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.15",
      "source_sha256": "fb5aaf9d0959e3e4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but that all this be fulfilled"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.16",
      "source_sha256": "39245b830fc26004",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the Antichrist"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.17",
      "source_sha256": "3c180b8eb616966d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. by the light of Christ's divinity"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.18",
      "source_sha256": "ed32a36fe0ff921f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will be opposed to God and to his gospel"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.19",
      "source_sha256": "81ceb5f3dd5b6c5e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they will all be false"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.20",
      "source_sha256": "ab38b71e7facb02e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will work false miracles and false signs, as the magicians (druids) worked them through him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.21",
      "source_sha256": "d44b0eb6a94490a6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they will be turned to iniquity"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.22",
      "source_sha256": "312e18e8a40efa92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. if they had received it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.23",
      "source_sha256": "9f34cae03c2f1990",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Their excuse will not avail them at the hour of judgement, when it will be said to them, 'Why did you not believe in Christ?' 'Not we,' [they will say,] 'because we did not recognise him, and his humanity concealed his divinity.' 'Yet you believed in the demon, though he had flesh about him.' It is fitting, then, that those who did not accept being in the glory of Christ should be in torment with the devil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.24",
      "source_sha256": "67e06254f94a612c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. [?] God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.25",
      "source_sha256": "1f348f4222a56258",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the apostleship, so that you might take example from us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.26",
      "source_sha256": "595879a07d594dfa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. which is with you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.27",
      "source_sha256": "c4d207d723d60c3b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. through our preaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.28",
      "source_sha256": "62049c4fcaa984f3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you may be in glory with Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.29",
      "source_sha256": "5bfdb8f2ed4cfdc3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Here he shows the Trinity: the Son when he says 'our Lord', the Father when he says 'God', the Holy Spirit when he says 'comforter'."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.30",
      "source_sha256": "d8baac1826f2fcb2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let your deed and your word be good, for that will be enough for you, [and] nothing else"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.31",
      "source_sha256": "41ae1f97e32215ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. from here onward"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.32",
      "source_sha256": "2e07f8382bc511a3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. disciples ought to pray for their teachers"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.33",
      "source_sha256": "e86c87760e5f3f9c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in the heart of everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26a.34",
      "source_sha256": "216642eec3d5537a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not pray for other things, but only for the success of the preaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.1",
      "source_sha256": "57ab435cf9e5d912",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. who wish evil to us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.2",
      "source_sha256": "629904bddb37b452",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Not all are perfect"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.3",
      "source_sha256": "f2ebbf6fb5e54919",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is clear that not all are perfect"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.4",
      "source_sha256": "dcd93681cbfec706",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he is able to protect you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.5",
      "source_sha256": "49a614180f35a344",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is we who trust"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.6",
      "source_sha256": "b142282f4fc67fec",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you have fulfilled what we preached to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.7",
      "source_sha256": "213b071aba2855b6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you may take example from Christ, as he was patient in suffering tribulations; or, so that you may be patient in awaiting the Day of Judgement"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.8",
      "source_sha256": "564fb3e59848ba52",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we beseech you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.9",
      "source_sha256": "eb87af4b79ca277e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who begs"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.10",
      "source_sha256": "8400547e16fc8736",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the restless one"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.11",
      "source_sha256": "4ceae3a79ef8d6bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is not from us that they got what they saw with us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.12",
      "source_sha256": "4e8b4d329da59e0e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you are knowledgeable about it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.13",
      "source_sha256": "4f1a5896cb12331e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that you might take example from us in the manner in which we were there [with you], i.e. not restlessly"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.14",
      "source_sha256": "b0d4c5343dcfe7fa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. we were not restless in begging among you; or, we were not burdensome"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.15",
      "source_sha256": "c4eff198fa33cf0b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the knowing ones"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.16",
      "source_sha256": "e12835d167c5b878",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. unless we had earned it [?] from the fruit of our hands"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.17",
      "source_sha256": "ae9f7e0b40f958b0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "we used to make rope at night, preaching by day"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.18",
      "source_sha256": "0ae8659291c71cd6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. so that we might be [?] for you, for taking an example from us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.19",
      "source_sha256": "d47688dd16a58a7e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "we used to say to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.20",
      "source_sha256": "aabbb24bb950cc78",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. this is the penance of God for it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.21",
      "source_sha256": "bdd05890d55842e9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "that this might be the punishment upon them, i.e. that they should be without food unless [?] [they work?] [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.22",
      "source_sha256": "5dcec62f55872c98",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. in vices"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.23",
      "source_sha256": "3d31659787e6ca5d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. your correction would not be too ready, unless we had heard bad tidings of you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.24",
      "source_sha256": "6399c0cb3d821804",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. they inquire which place among them has good hospitality"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.25",
      "source_sha256": "6e337aee62c53bdb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. without asking anything of anyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.26",
      "source_sha256": "c03d9560f573b15a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. rebuke (him)"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.27",
      "source_sha256": "9923fa9d08cdf226",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. to see whether his expulsion from the unity of the brethren (fratrum) may be a cause of healing to him, for it is a shame to him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.28",
      "source_sha256": "83ce312e5d4dd3e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. let his correction not be hostile"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.29",
      "source_sha256": "5271836bf80f4edd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. admonish (him)"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.30",
      "source_sha256": "27b8e16672e957e0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. that you may have peace with everyone, and everyone with you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.31",
      "source_sha256": "58404b72398b317f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. that it is this below that he wrote, so that it might be known to them that it is in every epistle as his own sign"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2thess#Wb.26b.32",
      "source_sha256": "329064c799ea71eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "i.e. this below"
    }
  ]
}
